      "10": {
        "attributes": {
          "alignment": {
            "type": "integer",
            "value": 0
          },
          "fill": {
            "type": "bool",
            "value": true
          },
          "font-size": {
            "type": "float",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "MESH 2D\n\nThe Mesh 2D node is the bucket you use to construct the mesh 2d type.\nThe Mesh 2D node combines geometry2d, transformation2d and material into a mesh 2d type.\n\nGeometry 2D can be produced by nodes like Rectangle, Circle and Triangle.\nTransformation 2D can be produced by the Transformation 2D node.\nMaterial can be produced by the Texture Material node, or by simply patching in a Texture2D RGBA signal."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 178.0704803466797,
          "width": 619.8876953125,
          "x": -324.99609375,
          "y": -128.3939208984375
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
